      "title": "向往的光明·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22021001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "完了，全完了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "这些家伙，一点都不讲武德！！那么多人，偷袭我一个！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "我才倒霉，好几个人抱住我的大腿，直接压在我身上！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "电锯熊",
          "text": "现在怎么办，被这些家伙抓走的手办，都不会有什么好下场吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "电锯熊",
          "text": "管理局的人可是警告我们，不要和这些奇怪的手办有任何接触的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "有人吗？有谁能救救我们吗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡基",
          "text": "叫什么叫，吵死了，就算你叫破喉咙，也不会有人来救你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡基",
          "text": "不过真要有手办被你叫过来了，我还真要感谢你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "咖啡崽",
          "text": "没错，我们几十个兄弟在这里！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "咖啡崽",
          "text": "哼哼，只要不是那些讨厌的猫猫狗狗跑过来，绝对都能让他们有来无回。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猫",
          "text": "喵——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "咖啡崽",
          "text": "猫……猫！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡基",
          "text": "怎么真有猫出现了？？？你不会是管理局派来的奸细吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "咖啡崽",
          "text": "我也不知道……为什么真的会有猫过来啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡基",
          "text": "大家快逃！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "也带上我们一起啊……！救命！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "等等，你们有没有觉得……那只猫有些眼熟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22021018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "电锯熊",
          "text": "你这样说的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "喂，你们几个还好吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "是你！！那个管理局的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "你，你是天使吗……每次都能在我们危险的时候赶过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我可不是天使，真要感谢的话就好好去感谢拉斐尔吧。这只猫可是她找来的帮手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "拉斐尔……为什么会……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "唔，难道那只猫是……和你一伙的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什么啊！我们可是好心来救你的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猫",
          "text": "喵！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柠檬仔",
          "text": "呜哇啊，对不起，猫大人，是我说错话了，不要吃我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "优纪，我们走吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔？？这就走了吗？不用跟他们解释清楚吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "我之前要帮他们……并不是想要让他们理解我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "而且，我已经有了更重要的朋友，你们能够理解我……就足够了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "被拉斐尔这样盯着，我会不好意思的啦~嘿嘿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "你们也赶紧离开这里吧，他们只是暂时被赶跑了……不知道什么时候还会回来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "之后还请小心，因为以后我们不会总是及时赶到的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩具兔",
          "text": "拉斐尔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猫",
          "text": "喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "唔，猫先生……请，请不要再舔了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "它好像真的很喜欢拉斐尔呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22022021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这样就算以后没有猫薄荷，拉斐尔也会是它很好的朋友了呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-475",
